      "id": 1,
      "text": "Erving was first settled by white settlers in 1801 and officially incorporated in 1838, nearly the last unincorporated land in Massachusetts.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
